  "translation": "I got up at seven in the morning. I first went to the bathroom to wash my face, then ate a piece of bread and also drank a cup of milk. My home has this one cat; it is really cute. I go to school at eight, that school is behind my home. I go to class together with classmates. Today we all have Chinese class, the teacher teaches us Chinese characters. I am learning many Chinese characters, and I can also write them. I asked the teacher what time it is now. I don't know how many Chinese characters there are. I go home in the afternoon. In the evening I do homework at home. I go to sleep at ten o'clock."
